**Proof.** The native guards give the first assertion. The actual
unticked collision is proved in Boundary 4.4. The C assertion has its
separate all-policy coupling proof in §9. These conclusions each
retain their own domain and resource coordinate. They do not compare
all possible carriers, seeds, record conventions, noise models or
controllers. A binding and current authority are also indispensable
premises for an actual call in this installation: copying all numerical
